  "question": {
    "text": "If $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots, a_n, \\ldots$. are in A.P. such that $a_4-a_7$ $+a_{10}=m$, then the sum of first 13 terms of this A.P., is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "tq25G",
      "text": "\n$10 \\mathrm{~m}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "O247K",
      "text": "\n$12 \\mathrm{~m}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "CJu3O",
      "text": "\n$13 \\mathrm{~m}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "G6ykh",
      "text": "\n$15 \\mathrm{~m}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "If $d$ be the common difference, then\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm & =a_4-a_7+a_{10}=a_4-a_7+a_7+3 \\mathrm{~d}=a_7 \\\\\n\\mathrm{~S}_{13} & =\\frac{13}{2}\\left[a_1+a_{13}\\right]=\\frac{13}{2}\\left[a_1+a_7+6 d\\right] \\\\\n& =\\frac{13}{2}\\left[2 a_7\\right]=13 a_7=13 \\mathrm{~m}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
